1. Upstream project (derived work)
===============================================================================
This project is a derivative of "batch-document-printer" (办公文档批量打印器):
    https://github.com/icescat/batch-document-printer
    Author: 喵言喵语 (icescat), Copyright (c) 2024
    License: MIT (declared in the upstream README; the upstream repository does
             not ship a LICENSE file, so the standard MIT text is reproduced in
             our LICENSE together with the original copyright line).
The GUI, document list, handler/registry architecture, page counting and the
SumatraPDF integration originate from the upstream project. The original
author information is retained in LICENSE, NOTICE, README and the About dialog.

===============================================================================
2. Reference implementation for WPS COM automation
===============================================================================
The WPS COM ProgIDs and calling conventions (KWPS.Application,
KET.Application, KWPP.Application; pythoncom.CoInitialize + Dispatch;
Documents/Workbooks/Presentations.Open; Quit handling) were studied from:
    harness-anything - cli_anything/wps/utils/wps_backend.py
    https://github.com/yb2460/harness-anything
    Copyright (c) 2026 cli-anything-wps contributors
    License: MIT (full text: licenses/harness-anything-LICENSE.txt)
No harness-anything framework code is included; the backend layer in
src/backends/ is an independent implementation informed by that reference.

